# OpsHub workspace boundary — T0001, contract docs/contracts/C-T0001-v1.md (owner-approved 2026-10-16).
# A new ignore rule or a new tracked root-level file needs a versioned C-T0001 amendment.

# --- Private custody: originals stay only on the owner's disk, never in Git or its history ---
/source/
/evidence/artifacts/text/*.extracted.txt
/evidence/artifacts/text/*.blocks.json
/evidence/artifacts/text/*.pdf-text.json
/evidence/artifacts/text/review-page-*.png
/evidence/live/phase1b/assets/
# Real-data or private fixtures. Synthetic fixtures under tests/fixtures/ stay tracked.
/tests/fixtures/private/
*.private.*

# --- Secrets and credentials ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.npmrc
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
secrets/
secret/

# --- Dependencies, build and test output ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
*.tsbuildinfo
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Local tooling and OS files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
